    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hatch. Evolve. Collect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/c8d6694e7aa6322c54ab6d5cf4923945.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/c8d6694e7aa6322c54ab6d5cf4923945.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/c8d6694e7aa6322c54ab6d5cf4923945.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch, feed and play with your monsters to evolve them into their ultimate forms. Each monster you evolve is a new entry in your Codex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/3c33356f873f45bed0d0a3ab5c4af820.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/3c33356f873f45bed0d0a3ab5c4af820.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/3c33356f873f45bed0d0a3ab5c4af820.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Evo Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/b5a0d4fa98e34dd9d6cbce277e84c488.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/b5a0d4fa98e34dd9d6cbce277e84c488.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/b5a0d4fa98e34dd9d6cbce277e84c488.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all monsters evolve the same way. Some need special Evo Items to trigger their transformations. Discover all of the combinations to complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/d949991f6a9a6031250ed48477b69bc9.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/d949991f6a9a6031250ed48477b69bc9.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/d949991f6a9a6031250ed48477b69bc9.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >While you Work!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/af1f1fb4ac2c8ce8d8fd1ac1e2057e80.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/af1f1fb4ac2c8ce8d8fd1ac1e2057e80.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/af1f1fb4ac2c8ce8d8fd1ac1e2057e80.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This idle desktop companion runs quietly in the background while you use your computer, giving you a fun and relaxing way to build your monster collection over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your Favourite Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a rare egg? Evolved a monster into a special form? Use the built-in screenshot tool to snap and share your favourite moments with friends and the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flexible Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise how the game behaves - Keep it tucked behind your windows, or bring it to the front. Switch the game to another monitor, change the colour scheme and more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hatch. Evolve. Collect!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/c8d6694e7aa6322c54ab6d5cf4923945.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/c8d6694e7aa6322c54ab6d5cf4923945.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/c8d6694e7aa6322c54ab6d5cf4923945.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch, feed and play with your monsters to evolve them into their ultimate forms. Each monster you evolve is a new entry in your Codex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/3c33356f873f45bed0d0a3ab5c4af820.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/3c33356f873f45bed0d0a3ab5c4af820.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/3c33356f873f45bed0d0a3ab5c4af820.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Evo Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/b5a0d4fa98e34dd9d6cbce277e84c488.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/b5a0d4fa98e34dd9d6cbce277e84c488.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/b5a0d4fa98e34dd9d6cbce277e84c488.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all monsters evolve the same way. Some need special Evo Items to trigger their transformations. Discover all of the combinations to complete your collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/d949991f6a9a6031250ed48477b69bc9.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/d949991f6a9a6031250ed48477b69bc9.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/d949991f6a9a6031250ed48477b69bc9.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >While you Work!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/af1f1fb4ac2c8ce8d8fd1ac1e2057e80.poster.avif?t=1747328423\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/af1f1fb4ac2c8ce8d8fd1ac1e2057e80.webm?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655520/extras/af1f1fb4ac2c8ce8d8fd1ac1e2057e80.mp4?t=1747328423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This idle desktop companion runs quietly in the background while you use your computer, giving you a fun and relaxing way to build your monster collection over time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share your Favourite Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a rare egg? Evolved a monster into a special form? Use the built-in screenshot tool to snap and share your favourite moments with friends and the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flexible Settings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise how the game behaves - Keep it tucked behind your windows, or bring it to the front. Switch the game to another monitor, change the colour scheme and more.</p>",
